OL,3,AWhat are my rights if my flight is
OL,4,Acancelled or delayed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of air passengers have seen
OL,7,Ftheir travel plans disrupted after an
OL,8,Fair traffic control problem grounded
OL,9,Fnearly 2,000 flights across the UK.
OL,11,FWhen a flight is cancelled or delayed,
OL,12,Fpassengers affected have various rights
OL,13,F` such as a refund or be put on another
OL,14,Fflight. However, these can vary
OL,15,Fdepending on which carrier you are
OL,16,Fflying with and from where.
OL,18,FOnly when an airline is at fault - not
OL,19,Fissues such as air traffic control
OL,20,Fproblems - is extra compensation
OL,21,Fpayable. Here's what it means for you.
OL,23,APub: 31-MayQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
