OL,3,AWhat are my rights if my flight is
OL,4,Acancelled or delayed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen flights are delayed or cancelled,
OL,7,FUK and EU airlines, and other carriers
OL,8,Fwhen you are departing a UK or EU
OL,9,Fairport, have a duty to look after you.
